<title>HONG KONG: Glorious Sun declares 1st interim results.</title>
<headline>Glorious Sun declares 1st interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.88</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    Nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.25</p>
<p>    Net			    99.75</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,179.10</p>
<p>Company name - Glorious Sun Enterprises Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Casual wear maker and retailer Glorious Sun was listed on the Stock Exchange on September 17, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain from interest on subscription money received for the listing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
